Text="Refraining from response can be very difficult, as the beep will come at the approximate time you will be responding. Sometimes you will be able to stop your response, and sometimes you will not be able to stop your response. Do not slow your responses in order to wait for beeps to occur. Continue to answer as quickly as possible to shapes. When beeps do occur, do your best at that point to refrain from response, realizing you will not be able to stop your response every time.\n\n(press any key to continue)"
